<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <title>Retrovizor UI v2</title>
        <style type="text/css">
            * {
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            html,
            body {
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
            }

            html {
                font-family: monospace;
                font-size: 16px;
                font-weight: normal;
                line-height: 24px;

                color: #e6e6ec;
                background: #16161d;
            }

            body {
                width: 100%;
                min-height: 100%;
                background: radial-gradient(#26262d, transparent);
            }

            main {
                max-width: 640px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                padding: 48px 16px;
            }

            nav {
                margin: 0 0 48px 0;
                text-align: center;
            }

            nav a {
                color: #b6b6bd;
                font-weight: normal;
                text-decoration: none;
                text-transform: uppercase;
            }

            ul {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;

                list-style-type: none;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .after,
            .before {
                display: inline-block;
            }

            .after {
                padding-left: 8px;
                color: #36363d;
            }

            .before {
                padding-right: 8px;
                color: #66666d;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <main>
            <nav>
                <a href="#">Home</a>
                <a href="#">Text</a>
                <a href="#">Code</a>
                <a href="#">User</a>
            </nav>
            <ul>
                <li><span class="before">#01</span>A first title<span class="after">.................</span></li>
                <li><span class="before">#02</span>Here comes the second title<span class="after">...</span></li>
                <li><span class="before">#03</span>Yet another title<span class="after">.............</span></li>
                <li><span class="before">#04</span>Now it's even an article!<span class="after">.....</span></li>
                <li><span class="before">#05</span>Almost the last shenanigan<span class="after">....</span></li>
                <li><span class="before">#06</span>Finally, that's it!<span class="after">...........</span></li>
            </ul>
        </main>
    </body>
</html>

